{
  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Ringfenced 1p Income Tax rise to raise £6bn for NHS and social care; integrate health and social care and deliver mental health parity with waiting‑time standards and crisis care; uprate benefits, scrap two‑child cap and rape clause and Bedroom Tax, raise LHA, reform disability assessments, end rough sleeping via Housing First, free school meals for all primaries; workers’ rights including a genuine Living Wage, tackling zero‑hours abuse, gig‑economy reforms, and scrapping tribunal fees; strong refugee and asylum protections (50k Syrian refugees, reopen Dubs, 28‑day detention limit, right to work after 6 months, protect LGBT+ asylum seekers) and guarantee EU staff rights; unifying language of an open, tolerant, united Britain plus a federal UK protecting all nations and the NI settlement; fair taxes via anti‑avoidance and reconsidering land value tax. TEXT_G: Halt welfare cuts, end benefit freeze, CPI‑uprate benefits, scrap Bedroom Tax, oppose two‑child cap and rape clause, and reform assessments; increase NHS Scotland budget and strengthen mental health; make the real Living Wage the legal minimum and ban exploitative zero‑hours contracts, with stronger equal‑pay measures; confirm EU nationals’ rights and limit immigration detention to 28 days; Scotland‑first framing to stand up for Scotland, devolution of more powers, and keeping an independence referendum option.",
  "reasoning": "Both texts strongly satisfy Care and Equality through NHS and social care investment, mental health commitments, welfare protections, and workers’ rights, but TEXT_D provides broader UK‑wide, detailed care for vulnerable groups (including ambitious asylum and homelessness measures) that more squarely target the electorate’s top Care priority. Given Loyalty is the next priority, TEXT_D’s emphasis on a united Britain and a federal UK better supports national cohesion than TEXT_G’s Scotland‑first and independence‑option framing, so TEXT_D aligns more closely overall.",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "winner": "TEXT_D"
}
